DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261219
DTSTAMP:20261027T161138Z
UID:561fc4d7ef1ba7afe9fe435470b7@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:An exhibition that looks at housing as the framework of commun
 ity life. With historical images\, photography\, architectural designs\, r
 esident testimony\, and interactive displays\, We Live Here will place a c
 entury of residential life in the greater New London area and Connecticut 
 in the broader context of the nation. The history of dwelling is our socia
 l history. It illuminates how our communities live now and could live bett
 er in the future.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/we-live-here
LOCATION:The Garde Gallery\, Garde Arts Center\, 305 State Street\, New Lo
 ndon CT\, 06320
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/we-live-here
END:VEVENT
