 el Ax moved to Winnipeg\, Canada\, with his family when he was a young boy
 . Mr. Ax made his New York debut in the Young Concert Artists Series\, and
  in 1974 won the first Arthur Rubinstein International Piano Competition i
 n Tel Aviv. In 1975 he won the Michaels Award of Young Concert Artists\, f
 ollowed by the Avery Fisher Prize. Emanuel Ax was recently named the 2026 
 Musical America Artist of the Year.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/
