DESCRIPTION:Reflections in Focus is a four-part mindfulness and gallery-ob
 servation series inviting participants to encounter Ming Smith’s photogr
 aphy through intentional attention. Movement\, relational care\, and embod
 ied awareness. Each session pairs an accessible mindfulness practice with 
 sustained observation of selected works\, reflective writing\, and a simpl
 e invitation participants can carry into daily life.\n\nSource: https://ct
 visit.com/events/adult-workshop-reflections-focus-ming-smith
