 onnecticut’s popular fair. Readings are 20 minutes for $25 (cash\, check
 s\, credit cards). Types include astrology\, tarot and other cards\, intui
 tive\, medium\, psychic and more. Vendors sell a wide array of wares\, suc
 h as crystals\, books\, CDs\, jewelry\, gifts and items for health and wel
 l-being. Wellness practitioners offer massage\, Reiki\, sound healing and 
 more. Free presentations cover a broad spectrum of the metaphysical world.
 \n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/new-age-fair-1
